WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:22.235
The Lemonade Detectives rode their bikes to the Sweet Shop as fast as they could.

2
00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:30.077
"I still don't believe Mrs. Sweet would do anything wrong," Maggie said as she leaned her bike against a lamppost in front of the shop.

3
00:00:30.078 --> 00:00:32.857
"I don't either," Henry said.

4
00:00:32.858 --> 00:00:42.101
"But a good detective has to investigate every lead and suspect."

5
00:00:42.102 --> 00:00:45.434
The bell jingled as they walked in.

6
00:00:45.435 --> 00:00:50.520
There were a few customers sitting at the tables inside, but there was no one in line.

7
00:00:50.521 --> 00:00:54.489
A young woman stood behind the counter, wiping it with a rag.

8
00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.376
Her name was Patty.

9
00:00:56.377 --> 00:01:02.371
Henry knew that she worked at the ice-cream parlor part-time to help pay for her college tuition.

10
00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:06.795
"Hi, Patty," he greeted her. "Is Mrs. Sweet here?"

11
00:01:06.796 --> 00:01:09.188
"Hi, Henry," Patty said.

12
00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:13.465
"Sorry, she's not here right now. She just stepped out to go to the bank."

13
00:01:13.466 --> 00:01:19.107
"Oh." Cole sounded disappointed. "We need to talk to her about something."

14
00:01:19.108 --> 00:01:22.063
"She'll be back in a few minutes," Patty said.

15
00:01:22.064 --> 00:01:24.333
"Want some ice cream while you wait?"

16
00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.301
That gave Henry an idea.

17
00:01:26.302 --> 00:01:30.828
Maybe he could start investigating even before Mrs. Sweet returned.

18
00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:37.423
"I tried one of the new flavors earlier—raspberry mint chip," he said.

19
00:01:37.424 --> 00:01:39.333
"It was really good.

20
00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:43.241
Do you know how Mrs. Sweet came up with the idea for that one?"

21
00:01:43.242 --> 00:01:48.017
Maggie shot him a strange look. Henry could almost read her mind.

22
00:01:48.018 --> 00:01:51.932
She was thinking, "Why do you care about that flavor?"

23
00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:53.647
Patty chuckled.

24
00:01:53.648 --> 00:01:59.257
"You know Mrs. Sweet; she always has a story about how she invents her flavors.

25
00:01:59.258 --> 00:02:04.997
She told me she was picking raspberries in her garden when she brushed against a pot of mint plants.

26
00:02:04.998 --> 00:02:08.145
The mint and the berries smelled delicious together.

27
00:02:08.146 --> 00:02:10.774
So she decided to experiment."

28
00:02:10.775 --> 00:02:15.170
"Cool," Henry said. "What about the other new flavor?

29
00:02:15.171 --> 00:02:18.707
Do you know how she got the idea for that one?"

30
00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:22.074
"You mean the bubble gum banana swirl?" Patty asked.

31
00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:26.136
When Henry nodded, she shrugged. "I'm not sure.

32
00:02:26.137 --> 00:02:31.807
When I asked Mrs. Sweet about that one, she just said that 'a little bird' had given her the idea."

33
00:02:31.808 --> 00:02:37.535
Henry traded a worried look with his friends. That sounded kind of suspicious!

34
00:02:37.536 --> 00:02:42.433
"It doesn't matter where she got the idea, though, because it turned out great," Patty went on.

35
00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:44.279
"Would you like a sample?"

36
00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:50.207
"Sure!" Cole said eagerly. "Thanks."

37
00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:53.203
Patty grabbed three small plastic spoons.

38
00:02:53.204 --> 00:02:59.613
Then she scooped out a mouthful of the bubble gum-banana-swirl ice cream for each of the kids.

39
00:02:59.614 --> 00:03:04.726
"Yum!" Cole said when he tasted it. "This is awesome!"

40
00:03:04.727 --> 00:03:07.339
"It sure is," Henry agreed.

41
00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:14.170
Now he could understand why Mr. Tate was so upset—the flavor tasted great!

42
00:03:14.171 --> 00:03:17.078
Just then some teenage girls came in.

43
00:03:17.079 --> 00:03:22.376
Patty went to wait on them, and Henry and his friends wandered away to talk.

44
00:03:22.377 --> 00:03:25.514
"What do you think?" Cole asked quietly.

45
00:03:25.515 --> 00:03:28.293
"I don't know," Henry said.

46
00:03:28.294 --> 00:03:35.485
"It's weird that Mrs. Sweet told Patty that a little bird gave her the idea for bubble gum banana swirl."

47
00:03:35.486 --> 00:03:41.060
Maggie frowned. "I still can't believe Mrs. Sweet would steal anything.

48
00:03:41.061 --> 00:03:45.262
We need to talk to her and find out her side of the story!"

49
00:03:45.263 --> 00:03:49.481
Henry nodded. "I hope she gets back soon."

50
00:03:49.482 --> 00:03:52.733
A few minutes later Mrs. Sweet finally returned.

51
00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:56.688
"Well, hello again, boys!" she greeted them.

52
00:03:56.689 --> 00:04:01.077
"Hi, Maggie! But what are you all doing here?

53
00:04:01.078 --> 00:04:04.883
Shouldn't someone be working at the lemonade stand?

54
00:04:04.884 --> 00:04:08.020
I hear your business is booming!"

55
00:04:08.021 --> 00:04:14.136
"It is," Maggie told her. "Our friend Nathan is watching the stand right now."

56
00:04:14.137 --> 00:04:19.173
"Yes," Henry said. "We were just over in West Belltown.

57
00:04:19.174 --> 00:04:24.253
There's a new business opening there this weekend. It's called the Dessert Den."

58
00:04:24.254 --> 00:04:27.201
Mrs. Sweet was still smiling.

59
00:04:27.202 --> 00:04:32.285
"Oh my, yes, I've heard about the Dessert Den," she said.

60
00:04:32.286 --> 00:04:40.782
"I suppose that means I'll have some competition now for Belltown's dessert eaters!" She chuckled.

61
00:04:40.783 --> 00:04:43.172
The kids exchanged looks.

62
00:04:43.173 --> 00:04:48.612
"Don't worry, I'll always like the Sweet Shop best," Maggie said quickly.

63
00:04:48.613 --> 00:04:54.597
"Um, actually there's a reason we were at the Dessert Den," Henry spoke up.

64
00:04:54.598 --> 00:04:57.272
"We're investigating a mystery."

65
00:04:57.273 --> 00:05:00.490
"Oh? What sort of mystery?"

66
00:05:00.491 --> 00:05:05.593
Mrs. Sweet was bustling around, straightening the napkin dispensers on the tables.

67
00:05:05.594 --> 00:05:13.273
"Well," said Cole. "The owner of the Dessert Den thinks someone stole the idea for his new ice-cream flavor.

68
00:05:13.274 --> 00:05:18.586
It was supposed to be a big secret. It's called bubble gum banana swirl."

69
00:05:18.587 --> 00:05:24.299
"What?" Mrs. Sweet stopped what she was doing and spun to stare at Cole.

70
00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.291
"Bubble gum banana swirl? Are you sure?"

71
00:05:28.292 --> 00:05:34.607
"Yes. Mr. Tate thinks you, um, stole his flavor," Henry blurted out.

72
00:05:34.608 --> 00:05:38.221
"We told him there had to be some kind of mistake, but—"

73
00:05:38.222 --> 00:05:43.241
"Excuse me, kids." Mrs. Sweet wasn't smiling anymore.

74
00:05:43.242 --> 00:05:46.003
"I have something important to do."

75
00:05:46.004 --> 00:05:49.826
"But Mrs. Sweet . . ." Maggie began.

76
00:05:49.827 --> 00:05:54.444
It was too late. Mrs. Sweet was already rushing away.

77
00:05:54.445 --> 00:06:01.100
A second later she disappeared into the back room of the shop.
